# This MVP runs HEURISTIC / NO AI; no provider credentials are needed.
# Live model integration is not implemented. Do not add API keys.
# Optional browser location override; default is project-local .browsers.
# PLAYWRIGHT_BROWSERS_PATH=/absolute/path/to/playwright-browsers
# Optional read-only reuse of an existing Chromium executable:
# PLAYWRIGHT_EXECUTABLE_PATH=/absolute/path/to/chrome-headless-shell
